# Prince Tires — Tire Shop in Calgary, Alberta

> Family-owned tire shop in Calgary since 2021, rated 4.9 stars. Two locations. Sells and installs winter and snow tires, all-season, all-weather, all-terrain, light truck and trailer tires, plus wheels and rims. Services: tire installation, flat tire repair, wheel balancing, road force balancing (Edmonton Trail NE only), tire rotation, seasonal changeover, TPMS. Price Match Guarantee on any written quote from another Calgary tire shop.

Prince Tires is an independent tire retailer and installer serving Calgary. It is not a franchise or a national chain. Online booking, wholesale and fleet pricing, and same-day installation where the size is in stock.

