## Services

- [Tire installation](https://princetires.ca/pages/tire-installation-calgary): mounting, balancing, valve stems, TPMS reset, torque to spec
- [Flat tire repair](https://princetires.ca/pages/tire-repair-calgary): permanent internal patch-plug, warrantied for the life of the tire
- [Wheel balancing](https://princetires.ca/pages/tire-balancing): computer spin balancing
- [Road force balancing](https://princetires.ca/pages/road-force-balancing): load-roller balancing and match mounting for vibrations a standard balance can't fix — Edmonton Trail NE location only
- [Tire rotation](https://princetires.ca/pages/tire-rotation): drivetrain-correct rotation patterns
- [Seasonal tire changeover](https://princetires.ca/pages/seasonal-tire-change-calgary): winter/summer swap for sets already on rims
- [TPMS service](https://princetires.ca/pages/tpms-calgary): sensor replacement, programming and resets
- [Fleet and commercial tires](https://princetires.ca/pages/fleet-tires-calgary): volume pricing and direct billing
- [Book an appointment](https://princetires.ca/pages/booking): online booking for any service

## Brands stocked

Michelin, Bridgestone, BFGoodrich, Toyo, Yokohama, Continental, Cooper, Firestone, General Tire, Kumho, Mickey Thompson, Falken, Nexen, Dunlop. Wheels: XF Off-Road, Armed Offroad, RTX, Envy, RSSW. [All brands](https://princetires.ca/pages/brands).

